1. [5”] 一个荷质比 $\gamma$，角动量 $L$ 的粒子具有磁矩

$$
\mu = \pi r^2 \cdot \frac{q}{2\pi/\omega} = \frac{q\omega r^2}{2} = \frac{\gamma}{2}L = gL \tag{1}
$$

因此总磁矩为

$$
\mu = \frac{\gamma L}{2} = \frac{\sigma}{2\sigma_m} \frac{2}{3} 4\pi R^2 \sigma_m R^2 \omega = \frac{4\pi\sigma\omega R^4}{3} \tag{2}
$$

2. [10”] $\theta$ 处的环在轴线在球心处产生磁场（由角动量方向算起的角度 $\theta$）

$$
\mathrm{d}B = \frac{\mu_0}{4\pi} \frac{2\pi R\sin\theta \cdot R\mathrm{d}\theta \cdot \sigma \cdot \omega R\sin\theta}{R^2} \sin\theta = \frac{1}{2}\mu_0\sigma\omega R\sin^3\theta \mathrm{d}\theta \tag{3}
$$

$$
B = \int \mathrm{d}B = \int_0^\pi \mathrm{d}\theta \frac{1}{2}\mu_0\sigma\omega R\sin^3\theta = \frac{2}{3}\mu_0\sigma\omega R \tag{4}
$$

3. [10”] 以磁荷的观点来看，旋转的均匀带电球等效于轴线上两个球心有微小距离，带均匀相反磁荷的球体。同电学中情形类似，旋转的均匀带电球是均匀磁化的，在外部可看作点偶极子，内部磁场均匀。

由上一小问知，球壳内部磁场大小为 $\frac{2}{3}\mu_0\sigma\omega R$，方向同 $\omega$。球外是偶极子场。

$$
B = \frac{\mu_0\mu}{4\pi r^3}\left(2\cos\theta\hat{r} + \sin\theta\hat{\theta}\right) = \frac{\mu_0\sigma\omega R^4}{3r^3}\left(2\cos\theta\hat{r} + \sin\theta\hat{\theta}\right) \tag{5}
$$

4. [25”] 球壳变速时改变磁场，产生感应电场。记内球角速度，磁矩为 $\omega', \mu'$ 外球 $\theta$ 处磁通量是

$$
\begin{aligned}
\Phi &= \pi(2R\sin\theta)^2 \frac{\mu_0\mu}{2\pi(2R)^3} + \int_0^\theta 8\pi R^2\sin\theta \mathrm{d}\theta \frac{2\mu_0\mu'\cos\theta}{4\pi(2R)^3} \\
&= \frac{\mu_0(\mu+\mu')\sin^2\theta}{4R} \tag{6}
\end{aligned}
$$

外球受力矩为（注意 $\mu = gL$）

$$
\begin{aligned}
\tau &= -\lambda\omega - \int_0^\pi \mathrm{d}\theta \sigma(2R)^2\sin\theta \frac{\mathrm{d}\Phi}{\mathrm{d}t} = -\lambda\omega - \int_0^\pi \mathrm{d}\theta \mu_0\sigma R\sin^3\theta \frac{\mathrm{d}(\mu+\mu')}{\mathrm{d}t} \\
&= -\frac{3\lambda L}{8\pi\sigma_m R^4} - 2(\tau+\tau') \tag{7}
\end{aligned}
$$

内球 $\theta$ 处磁通量是

$$
\Phi' = \pi(R\sin\theta)^2 \left[\frac{\mu_0\mu}{2\pi(2R)^3} + \frac{\mu_0\mu'}{2\pi R^3}\right] = \frac{\mu_0(\mu+8\mu')\sin^2\theta}{16R} \tag{8}
$$

内球受电力矩

$$
\tau' = -\int_0^\pi \mathrm{d}\theta \sigma R \frac{\mathrm{d}\Phi'}{\mathrm{d}t} = -\frac{1}{8}(\tau+8\tau') \tag{9}
$$

由两力矩方程得到

$$
a = \frac{3\lambda}{8\pi\sigma_m R^4} \tag{10}
$$

$$
I'\frac{\mathrm{d}\omega'}{\mathrm{d}t} = -\frac{1}{16}I\frac{\mathrm{d}\omega}{\mathrm{d}t} \tag{11}
$$

$$
I\frac{\mathrm{d}\omega}{\mathrm{d}t} = -\frac{8a}{23}I\omega \tag{12}
$$

解得（$I = 16I'$）

$$
\omega = \omega_0 \exp\left(-\frac{3\lambda}{23\pi\sigma_m R^4}t\right) \tag{13}
$$

$$
\omega' = \omega_0\left[1 - \exp\left(-\frac{3\lambda}{23\pi\sigma_m R^4}t\right)\right] \tag{14}
$$

